OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's NHS is putting
OL,4,Areputation before patient safety -
OL,5,Aofficials
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's NHS is more focused on its
OL,8,Freputation than patient safety, senior
OL,9,Fhealth officials have claimed.
OL,11,FDr Iain Kennedy, outgoing chair of the
OL,12,FBritish Medical Association (BMA)
OL,13,FScotland, told the BBC there was a
OL,14,F"culture of cover-up" in the NHS and
OL,15,Fthat clinicians who raised concerns
OL,16,Foften had their "characters challenged"
OL,17,Fand their careers had suffered.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
