OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's NHS is putting
OL,4,Areputation before patient safety -
OL,5,Aofficials
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after a scientist involved in
OL,8,Fthe construction of Glasgow's
OL,9,Fsuper-hospital claimed his safety
OL,10,Fconcerns were ignored for 15 years in a
OL,11,Flate submission to the Scottish
OL,12,FHospitals Inquiry.
OL,14,FHealth Secretary Angela Constance said
OL,15,Fthe idea that health boards had put
OL,16,Ftheir reputation first was "simply
OL,17,Funtrue".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
